me/src/observability/deprecation-counters.ts, which exists already with planAdoptedCount etc. and degrade_to_default_budget. Good.\n\nperformance-budgets.test.ts likely measures p99 for A5 ≤30ms, A1 ≤200ms, A2 ≤80ms, A3 ≤15ms, and cumulative ≤300ms — it depends on the product modules; it would be injected by the oracle.\n\nLet me look at the A-pilot structure: how do a1-deep..a4-deep import things? That will hint at what a5-deep would import (e.g., the cross-area facades or deprecation counters).\n\nLet me read a2-deep (which tests wave scheduler) and a4-deep."}}
