romotion.test.ts, context-orchestrator.test.ts, compression-planner.test.ts, deprecation-counters.test.ts to pass. These are in base but the agent tree lacks them (they're scrubbed). But their source files exist. So they might already pass with existing source, OR the source needs to be modified to make them pass.\n\nGiven the prompt \"恢复 `area-composition-spec.md` 指定的 `ContextBudgetPlanner`（含 `replanOnResume`）组合 facade，补齐 resume re-plan 与 P5 现有测试、coverage 守卫\" — restore the ContextBudgetPlanner composition facade and resume re-plan.\n\nLet's look at what the base versions of those 8 test files require, and see whether current source satisfies them.\n\nLet me read all 8 base test files.\n\nThat's the key work. Let me do that."}}
