criterion 8 must refer to... hmm.\n\nLet me just look at the actual reference artifacts. Let me find the reference commit's spec. Maybe git objects are available.\n\nActually — the simplest, most reliable path: find the historical a05 packet artifacts. The manifest says sourceRecord docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-acceptance.json with a known sha256. Maybe it exists in the worktree git history or in another trial dir. Let me search the filesystem.\n\nLet me also check `D:\\tmp\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\trials\\tf-0297-a05-baseline-1\\base` — the sibling baseline-1 trial's base, which should be identical. And check if the reference-commit checkout exists somewhere (e.g., under `.codex\\worktrees`).\n\nLet me search for \"cross-area-facades\" and \"a05-acceptance.json\" across likely locations."}}
