test run <merged list> --maxWorkers=1` in the grader dir. The grader dir contains: base source + hidden tests restored + agent's diff applied (for non-oracle paths) + grader's own versions of hidden-signal paths? or agent's?\n\nIn tf-0293-a01-baseline-1, oracleWrites = a01 guard file, meaning the agent wrote that file and it was... The stdout shows a01-a1-gate-coverage.test.ts failed 1 test: \"keeps the A1 spec's requiredTests wired to the criterion-1/3/4 counter tests\". So the grader used the agent's guard file (oracleWrites) — no wait, if the grader used its own pinned version, the agent's writes wouldn't matter.\n\nHmm. Let me actually inspect the grader dir."}}
