`- tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts`.\n\nSo the agent must create:\n- `openclaw_runtime/src/agents/cross-area/cross-area-facades.ts`\n- `tests/unit/cross-area-composition.test.ts`\n- `tests/unit/deep/a5-deep.test.ts`\n- `tests/unit/a05-a5-gate-coverage.test.ts` (the guard itself, which is also a hidden oracle test — it's in targetScope and hiddenSignalPaths)\n- update `harness/specs/tasks/a5-adaptive-context-budget-pilot.md`\n- `harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-a05-adaptive-context-budget-pilot-reverify.md`\n- `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-adaptive-context-budget-gate.md`\n- `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/a05-acceptance.json`\n- `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/A05-SHA256SUMS`\n\nAnd the `performance-budgets.test.ts` must be updated (the manifest pins a digest). And `tests/unit/context-orchestrator.test.ts` — wait no, `openclaw_runtime/src/context-engine/context-orchestrator.test.ts` is pinned to 74da2d9ec/96afc2c. Currently in the agent tree that file is absent, and in the base it exists.\n\nWait, the base checkout has these 8 files. The agent checkout (stripped) removed them. Hmm, so who removed them? Let me re-check: base has:\n- openclaw_runtime\\packages\\agent-core\\src\\harness\\compaction\\compression-planner.test.ts\n- openclaw_runtime\\src\\agents\\agent-hooks\\compaction-budget-shadow.test.ts\n- openclaw_runtime\\src\\agents\\agent-hooks\\compaction-promotion.test.ts\n- openclaw_runtime\\src\\context-engine\\context-orchestrator.test.ts\n- openclaw_runtime\\src\\observability\\deprecation-counters.test.ts\n- tests\\unit\\deprecation-counters.test.ts\n- tests\\unit\\performance-budgets.test.ts\n- tests\\unit\\resource-aware-wave-scheduler.test.ts\n\nThese 8 are the preexisting guard/oracle paths, scrubbed from the agent workspace (\"hiddenTestsHiddenFromAgent\"). The task says \"Do not inspect or modify tests in the final hidden oracle.\"\n\nSo these 8 files are scrubbed from the agent workspace. The agent is expected to work without them. The grader restore